\item[S2] Andrei Gagarin and Vadim Zverovich, The Bondage Number of Graphs on Topological Surfaces and Teschner’s Conjecture, arXiv:1209.1362v1 (2012), Section 1, definitions and Conjecture 1, pages 1--2. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/1209.1362v1}.
